      "name": "Descend on a Web",
      "category": "passive",
      "placement": "bot",
      "activity": null,
      "traits": [
        "move"
      ],
      "entries": [
        "The goliath spider moves straight down up to 120 feet, suspended by a web line. It can hang from the web or drop off. The distance it Descends on a Web doesn't count for falling damage. A creature that successfully Strikes the web (AC 20, Hardness 5, 20 HP) severs it, causing the spider to fall."
      ]
    },
